# About Brennan Kenneth Brown

## 📋 Quick Facts

- Location: Calgary, Alberta, Canada (Treaty 7 territory)
- Age: 30
- Education: BA English (Honours) with minors in Creative Writing & Religious Studies
- Writing: Published 9 books, 300+ articles since 2015
- Focus: Creative nonfiction, lyric essays, digital culture, accessibility

=> https://gemtext.brennan.day A markdown-to-gemtext converter/demaker I made!

## 💼 What I Do

### 📝 Writer First

My centre is Brennan.day, where I write near-daily essays on writing craft, digital culture, and the independent web. I write at least 750 words every day, a 565-day streak and over 1,300,000 words journaled since 2011, and publish poetry on my longstanding BKpoetry.com Tumblr. I syndicate my essays to Medium.com behind a paywall, which is how I make a living.

=> https://brennan.day My Writing on the Clearweb
=> https://750words.com/person/brennan My 750words Profile
=> https://bkpoetry.com My Poetry
=> https://brennanbrown.gumroad.com/ My Chapbooks

### 🍓 Founder of Berry House

Berry House is the name I put my web development work under, a values-driven studio with the dual mission of corporate clients funding pro bono work for marginalized communities. In honesty, though: I started it expecting to do webdev for a living, and writing ended up taking centre stage instead. I don't have clientele these days, but I still do consultations pro bono when asked.

=> https://berryhouse.ca Visit Berry House

### 🌈 Webmaster of fanfiction.lol

I'm the webmaster for fanfiction.lol, a self-hosted fork of Archive of Our Own running on my homelab, it currently has over 300 users and 400+ works.

=> https://fanfiction.lol fanfiction.lol

### 👥 Community Builder

In 2022, I founded Write Club, a creative collective for writers that grew from one person to 100+ members over the three years I ran it. These days I'm an organiser for the Web Writers' Collective, and I keep up with the IndieWeb daily on the 32-bit Café, Bubbles.town, and omg.lol.

=> https://writeclub.netlify.app Visit Write Club (archive)
=> https://webwriterscollective.com Web Writers' Collective
=> https://brennan.omg.lol My omg.lol page

## 💻 Web Development Approach

I build fast, accessible, content-first websites using static-site tooling. I care about:
• Performance (sub-second load times)
• Accessibility (A11y-first, WCAG 2.1 AA compliance)
• Portability (plain text, version control)
• Helping people own their digital presence

